name=GoM Extension: Guns of Tien
id=GoMExtensionGunsOfTien
description=More ammunition for Guns of Marz, all real loads of 1993: subsonic, hollow point, soft point, steel core, +P and +P+ rounds, birdshot and the AS VAL's SP-6. Adjusted gun sounds, full metal jacket rifle rounds pierce, the break-action shotguns' stocks can be sawn off to fit a holster, an AWC Mk9 suppressor for the MP5 and the Uzis, the MP5 family drawn to the Uzis' scale (the MP5 shown as the MP5A3), the Uzi, Mini Uzi and Micro Uzi, the Steyr AUG A1 with its integral scope and folding front grip, and the M249 light machine gun; belt-fed guns (the M249 and the M60) now need belt links, found or made. With Ammo Maker, every new round can be made. Needs Gunworks-gang and Guns of Marz. Every gun is held and reloaded with Guns of Marz's own animations.
